ie, bras and shapewear under Bali, Playtex, WonderBra, Maidenform, Bonds, Bras N Things, Berle brands. It sells its products to wholesale distributors, screenprinters, and embellishers in North America, Europe, the Asia-Pacific, and Latin America, as well as to retailers in North America, including mass merchants, department stores, national chains, specialty retailers, craft stores, and online retailers; and manufactures products for lifestyle brand companies. The company was formerly known as Textiles Gildan Inc. and changed its name to Gildan Activewear Inc. in March 1995. Gildan Activewear Inc. was founded in 1946 and is headquartered in Montreal, Canada.", "sector": "Consumer Cyclical", "industry": "Apparel Manufacturing"}, "valuation": {"pe": 36.39916, "pb": 3.37543, "ps": 3.9381843, "roe": 10.56, "net_margin": 6.1, "debt_to_equity": 149.31, "div_yield": 1.61, "rev_growth": 63.8, "market_cap": 16042225664.0, "forward_pe": 11.503582, "peg": 0.5528, "payout": 54.21, "five_yr_yield": 1.77, "pe_sector_med": 24.380182, "pb_sector_med": 7.2476773, "roe_sector_med": 28.14, "div_yield_sector_med": 2.74}, "archetype": "growth", "archetype_label": "Growth", "archetype_label_zh": "\u6210\u957f\u80a1", "consensus": {"n_analysts": 6, "target_mean": 106.92065, "target_high": 133.59828, "target_low": 86.27097, "rating_mean": null, "upside_pct": 23.4}, "positioning": {"shares_short": 4433942.0, "days_to_cover": 8.48, "short_pct_float": 2.7, "held_insiders": 0.58, "held_institutions": 94.3}}, "earnings": {"next_date": "2026-07-30", "surprises": [{"date": "2026-04-30", "eps": 0.43, "est": 0.35, "surprise_pct": 21.7}, {"date": "2026-02-26", "eps": 0.96, "est": 0.95, "surprise_pct": 0.8}, {"date": "2025-10-29", "eps": 1.0, "est": 0.98, "surprise_pct": 2.2}, {"date": "2025-07-31", "eps": 0.91, "est": 0.97, "surprise_pct": -6.3}]}, "factor_beta": {"oil": -0.158, "gold": -0.112, "cad": -0.219, "r2": 0.29, "n": 504, "primary": "usdcad", "primary_label": "CAD", "primary_label_zh": "\u